Original commit body from de5ca7e820ad2ff9ee8a555af7e21957564f722e:

The C half of the 2026-09-25 docstring-staleness audit: 24 module
docstrings silently omitted substantial behaviour their code has. Each
omission was verified against the code before it was written up; none
failed verification. Additions go into the docstrings' existing
sections, one short item per omission.

Largest additions:
- py.py: the repo-wide steps between the two passes (re-export
  aliasing, call-site parameter typing, class field maps, the Django
  relation index); @property read edges; builtin / external call edges;
  io_mode and call_arg_shape tags; __all__-based is_exported.
- java.py: field and enum-constant symbols; references / instantiates
  (::new) / decorated_by / module_attr_ref edges; the between-passes
  registries; the hand-off to the inherited_calls linker.
- rust.py, scala.py, php.py: variable-type inference and the ExternalRef
  module rebuild; scala's import-outranks-project-symbol rule and enum /
  given / val symbols; php's interface/trait/enum containers and use
  imports.
- profile.py: refine_frameworks' promote / demote phases,
  dev_frameworks and framework_evidence, structured manifest parsers.
- catalog.py, producer_coherence.py, symbol_resolution.py,
  validation.py, audit_findings.py, _text_filters.py: the halves of each
  module the docstring never described (depends_on CNF checks and axis
  resolvers; the ratchet API; the LRU index cache and disambiguation;
  serialization-format checks; the regression guards; the read-
  accounting layer).
- linkers (type_hierarchy, pyffi, graphql, airflow, django_orm,
  jackson): transitive base walks, INV-zuhub fallbacks, rank_score
  dampening, derived_from provenance, the root-field join.

Also: make.py's "Skip special targets" comment said the opposite of
the code (they are emitted with kind special_target); signature_axis
re-pins jackson_dispatch.py 299 -> 305; ARCHITECTURE.md regenerated.
No code changes.

